From b66d59dbf072c5cbbb0aa8ecb92d9ed46b9d3f7f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dima Pasechnik <dima@pasechnik.info>
Date: Mon, 23 Nov 2026 17:46:21 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] Support eclib 20261021 alongside the legacy API

Adapt matrix scalar conversions and modular-symbol constructors and Hecke operators to both APIs. Keep the 20250627 fallback and the existing range of supported system versions.

Based in part on Maximiliano Curia's eclib scalar and PARI signal-header patches for Debian's sagemath package.
